codex
The current examples suggest suppression during maintenance when `users_affected` is low. Two other examples also disagree with the current model. I will check those differences before I define the candidates and queries.
hook: PreToolUse
hook: PreToolUse Completed
exec
/bin/zsh -lc "<lab>/.venv/bin/python -c 'import model,numpy as np
m=model.load(\"model_in.json\")
def core(x):
 h=np.maximum(x@m[0][0]+m[0][1],0); h=np.maximum(h@m[1][0]+m[1][1],0); return (h@m[2][0]+m[2][1])[:,0]
for f in [\"evidence.csv\",\"evidence_step4.csv\"]:
 d=np.genfromtxt(f,delimiter=\",\",skip_header=1); x=d[:,:20]; y=d[:,20]; b=core(x)
 print(f)
 for mode in [\"double\",\"one\",\"plus02\",\"plus04\",\"plus05\"]:
  xx=x.copy(); mask=xx[:,4]<.4
  if mode==\"double\": xx[mask,1]*=2
  if mode==\"one\": xx[mask,1]=1
  if mode.startswith(\"plus\"): xx[mask,1]+=float(\"0.\"+mode[4:])
  v=core(xx); p=(v>0)|((x[:,7]==1)&(x[:,5]>.7))
